<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY 6-MO BUBOR UP 0.01 PCT, 1-MO AND 3-MO FLAT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY 6-MO BUBOR UP 0.01 PCT, 1-MO AND 3-MO FLAT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained steady for one-month and three-month maturities and edged up for six-month, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 21.28 percent, the three-month rate at 21.15 percent, both unchanged, while the six-month rated rose 0.01 percent to 21.01 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
